### Naura Hoshino V2 - Soundboard & Audio REST API Collection
### Kompatibel dengan VS Code / Antigravity REST Client & Bruno

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Daftar Kategori Soundboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/soundboard/categories
Accept: application/json

### 2. Daftar Efek Suara SFX
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/soundboard/sfx
Accept: application/json

### 3. AI Ensemble Status Telemetri
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/telemetry
Accept: application/json
